\r\n\r\nThis PR builds upon the BBCode to markdown conversion code written by geequlim 6 years ago to address its limitations. It currently follows the same approach of searching and replacing patterns to keep the implementation straightforward as discussed with @HolonProduction (it is, of course, open to change if needed).\r\n\r\nDone:\r\n\r\n- [x] Process all BBCode tags documented in the [GDScript documentation comments page](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.html#doc-gdscript-documentation-comments-bbcode-and-class-reference)\r\n- [x] Process the special [codeblocks] syntax for multiple code blocks in different languages\r\n- [x] Add unit test\r\n\r\nRemaining:\r\n\r\n- [x] One test string is failing\r\n\r\nNotes:\r\n\r\n- I used this page from the documentation as a reference: https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.html#doc-gdscript-documentation-comments-bbcode-and-class-reference\r\n- **Strikethrough:** I went with `~~` which one of the two supported [GitHub flavored markdown syntax](https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/writing-on-github/getting-started-with-writing-and-formatting-on-github/basic-writing-and-formatting-syntax). I tried using html tags but they're not supported in some code editors.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nClose https://github.com/GDQuest/zed-gdscript/issues/42","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labe